From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: onyx <onyx@localhost>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 09:30:43 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Settings: Add an allow restricted screenshots switch to
 Display

Settings.Secure.disable_secure_windows is read by WindowManager
(getDisableSecureWindows) to drop FLAG_SECURE so content that blocks
screenshots can be captured. Expose a Display switch for it, next to the
pure black and internet speed switches.
